 Fist","num":181,"desc":"Now powers up Punch-based moves by 50% (from 20%).","shortDesc":"Now powers up Punch-based moves by 50% (from 20%)."},"pixilate":{"name":"Pixilate","num":182,"desc":"Normal-type moves become Fairy-type moves.\\nThe power of those moves is boosted a little.","shortDesc":"Normal-type moves become Fairy-type moves.\\nThe power of those moves is boosted a little."},"gooey":{"name":"Gooey","num":183,"desc":"Contact with the Pokemon lowers the attacker\u2019s\\nSpeed stat.","shortDesc":"Contact with the Pokemon lowers the attacker\u2019s\\nSpeed stat."},"aerilate":{"name":"Aerilate","num":184,"desc":"Normal-type moves become Air-type moves.\\nThe power of those moves is boosted a little.","shortDesc":"Normal-type moves become Air-type moves.\\nThe power of those moves is boosted a little."},"hyperaggression":{"name":"Hyper Aggression","num":185,"desc":"Makes all moves hit twice. The second hit is\\n25% the power of the first.","shortDesc":"Makes all moves hit twice. The second hit is\\n25% the power of the first."},"darkaura":{"name":"Dark Aura","num":186,"desc":"Now powers up each Pokemon\u2019s Dark-type\\nmoves by 50%.","shortDesc":"Now powers up each Pokemon\u2019s Dark-type\\nmoves by 50%."},"fairyaura":{"name":"Fairy Aura","num":187,"desc":"Now powers up each Pokemon\u2019s Fairy-type\\nmoves by 50%.","shortDesc":"Now powers up each Pokemon\u2019s Fairy-type\\nmoves by 50%."},"aurabreak":{"name":"Aura Break","num":188,"desc":"The effects of \u201CAura\u201D Abilities are reversed\\nto lower the power of affected moves by 25%.","shortDesc":"The effects of \u201CAura\u201D Abilities are reversed\\nto lower the power of affected moves by 25%."},"lashingmonsoon":{"name":"Lashing Monsoon","num":189,"desc":"The Pokemon changes the weather to nullify\\nFire-type attacks, and summon heavy rain.","shortDesc":"The Pokemon changes the weather to nullify\\nFire-type attacks, and summon heavy rain."},"swelteringrays":{"name":"Sweltering Rays","num":190,"