ement if the target switches out."},"seaguardian":{"name":"Sea Guardian","num":199,"desc":"DOUBLES the power of Water moves, prevents burn\\nand halves damage taken from Fire moves.","shortDesc":"DOUBLES the power of Water moves, prevents burn\\nand halves damage taken from Fire moves."},"steelworker":{"name":"Steelworker","num":200,"desc":"Powers up Steel-type moves by 1.5x.","shortDesc":"Powers up Steel-type moves by 1.5x."},"berserk":{"name":"Berserk","num":201,"desc":"Boosts the Pokemon\u2019s Sp. Atk stat each time its\\nHP drops below 50%.","shortDesc":"Boosts the Pokemon\u2019s Sp. Atk stat each time its\\nHP drops below 50%."},"slushrush":{"name":"Slush Rush","num":202,"desc":"Doubles the Pokemon\u2019s Speed stat in a hailstorm.","shortDesc":"Doubles the Pokemon\u2019s Speed stat in a hailstorm."},"longreach":{"name":"Long Reach","num":203,"desc":"The Pokemon uses its moves without making contact\\nwith the target.","shortDesc":"The Pokemon uses its moves without making contact\\nwith the target."},"liquidate":{"name":"Liquidate","num":204,"desc":"Normal-type moves become Water-type moves.\\nThe power of those moves is boosted a little.","shortDesc":"Normal-type moves become Water-type moves.\\nThe power of those moves is boosted a little."},"triage":{"name":"Triage","num":205,"desc":"The Pokemon\'s moves that can heal gain +3 priority.","shortDesc":"The Pokemon\'s moves that can heal gain +3 priority."},"galvanize":{"name":"Galvanize","num":206,"desc":"Normal-type moves become Electric-type moves.\\nThe power of those moves is boosted a little.","shortDesc":"Normal-type moves become Electric-type moves.\\nThe power of those moves is boosted a little."},"voltrush":{"name":"Volt Rush","num":207,"desc":"Doubles the Pokemon\u2019s Speed stat on\\nElectric Terrain.","shortDesc":"Doubles the Pokemon\u2019s Speed stat on\\nElectric Terrain."},"schooling":{"name":"Schooling","num":208,"desc":"When it has a lot of HP, the Pokemon forms a\\npowerful school. It stops